AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_22693> "Members of the class of pyrimidones consisting of pyrimidine-2,4,6(1<em>H</em>,3<em>H</em>,5<em>H</em>)-trione (barbituric acid) and its derivatives. Largest group of the synthetic sedative/hypnotics, sharing a characteristic six-membered ring structure.")
