AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_28285> "An oligomycin with formula C<small><sub>45</sub></small>H<small><sub>74</sub></small>0<small><sub>11</sub></small>. An inhibitor of mitochondrial F<small><sub>1</sub></small>F<small><sub>O</sub></small> ATP synthase that induces apoptosis in a variety of cell types and exhibits antifungal, antitumour, and nematicidal activities, but its clinical application has been limited by poor solubility in water and other biocompatible solvents.")
