AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_29655> "A naphthoate ester obtained by formal condensation of the carboxy group of 2-hydroxy-7-methoxy-5-methyl-1-naphthoic acid with the 5-hydroxy group of (1a<i>S</i>,5<i>R</i>,6<i>R</i>,6a<i>E</i>,9a<i>R</i>)-5-hydroxy-1a-[(4<i>R</i>)-2-oxo-1,3-dioxolan-4-yl]-2,3,8,9-tetradehydro-1a,5,6,9a-tetrahydrocyclopenta[5,6]cyclonona[1,2-<em>b</em>]oxiren-6-yl 2,6-dideoxy-2-(methylamino)-α-<small>D</small>-galactopyranoside. The chromophoric part of neocarzinostatin, it is tightly and non-covelently bound to a 113-membered apoprotein, which serves to protect it and release it to the target DNA.")
